  "historyNote": "#8911, eff 6-20-07; ss by #11000, eff 2-1-16 (formerly Env-Wt 806.05); ss by #12808, eff 12-15-19 (See Revision Notes #1 and #2 at chapter heading for Env-Wt 800); ss by #13774, eff 10-13-23",
